    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2><br>King Pins is a small scale real-time strategy game.<br><br>Play short rounds of 20 to 60 minutes where you quickly build an army of one of the different civilizations: humans, goblins, elves and the undead! <br>You can even play locally with up to 4 people with controllers!<br>Collect resources and expand your territory while defending your main unit: the king!<br><br>If your king dies, you lose!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459870/extras/52b6ae8052a60d09b28c73b0a1f7955a.poster.avif?t=1639497860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459870/extras/52b6ae8052a60d09b28c73b0a1f7955a.webm?t=1639497860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459870/extras/52b6ae8052a60d09b28c73b0a1f7955a.mp4?t=1639497860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>~1 hour Campaign: a short story captured in challenging levels that you will teach you how to play the game<br></li><li>4 different civilizations, each play very differently!<br></li><li>then play versus match with up to 4 players locally<br></li><li>or, face off against computer controlled AI which you can set to 3 different difficulties. (or watch them fight each other instead!)<br></li><li>random generated maps, with each civilization having a multitude of buildings, unit and upgrades, make for endless possibilities!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1459870/extras/c350ac25322f0cc81d29044611c576b9.avif?t=1639497860\" /></div><br>Sokpop makes a new game every two weeks!<br>Subscribe for 3$ per month at ",
